<h1>LORDZ AI - Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="small">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>

<p>LORDZ AI is an AI chat assistant made by Swastik Saxena. This page explains what information the app uses and why.</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p><strong>Your chat messages.</strong> When you send a message, it (together with up to your last 20 messages from the current chat) is sent to our server and then to Google's Gemini API to generate a reply. We do not store your chats on our server or in a database.</p>
<p><strong>Name on your device.</strong> If you use Login or Sign Up, the name shown in the app is saved only in your own browser or app (local storage). It is not sent to us. Your email and password are not saved.</p>
<p><strong>Reports.</strong> If you tap "Report this reply", we receive the reported reply, your message that led to it, and any note you write. We use this only to improve safety and filtering.</p>
<p><strong>Technical logs.</strong> Our hosting provider (Vercel) may keep standard server logs, such as request time and IP address, for security and to prevent abuse.</p>

<h2>How information is used</h2>
<p>We use your messages only to produce AI replies, and reports only to review and improve the app. We do not sell your data and we do not show ads.</p>

<h2>Third-party services</h2>
<p>Your messages are processed by Google (Gemini API) and the app is hosted on Vercel. Their own privacy policies apply to the data they handle. Please do not share passwords, financial details or other sensitive personal information in the chat.</p>

<h2>AI-generated content</h2>
<p>Replies are generated by AI and can be wrong or inappropriate. Please do not rely on them for medical, legal or financial decisions. You can report any reply using the "Report this reply" button in the app.</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>LORDZ AI is not intended for children under 13.</p>

<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>Closing or refreshing the chat clears the conversation from the app. To ask about or remove a report you sent, contact us at the email below.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy and will change the date above when we do.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Email: <a href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL_HERE">YOUR_EMAIL_HERE</a></p>

